WEBVTT

00:00:00.948 --> 00:00:06.175
Welcome to Pragya Flow Finance, your desktop reconciliation workspace.

00:00:06.175 --> 00:00:11.403
Start a new reconciliation and select the bank and ledger files.

00:00:11.403 --> 00:00:16.630
This walkthrough uses two synthetic sample files, with no customer uploads.

00:00:17.663 --> 00:00:21.727
Review both files side by side.

00:00:21.727 --> 00:00:25.791
Map the reference, transaction date, signed amount, and currency.

00:00:25.791 --> 00:00:29.855
Required fields must match the sample schema before you can continue.

00:00:30.895 --> 00:00:35.097
A reusable workflow defines the matching policy.

00:00:35.097 --> 00:00:39.300
This sample compares exact references and signed amounts, in the same currency and on the same day.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:43.502
Ambiguous matches remain open.

00:00:47.462 --> 00:00:52.726
Run the sample preview to open the results dashboard.

00:00:52.726 --> 00:00:57.990
Twenty source records become sixteen matched records, two records with an amount difference, and two missing counterparts.

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:03.254
Open the full dashboard to see source totals and review workload.

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:09.981
The results separate matched records, differences, and missing counterparts.

00:01:09.981 --> 00:01:15.664
Search by reference or business, then open a transaction to inspect the evidence behind the result.

00:01:16.745 --> 00:01:20.492
Review the bank and ledger amounts side by side.

00:01:20.492 --> 00:01:24.240
Source file names and row numbers connect the result to its original records.

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:27.987
Differences are never silently written off.

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:34.426
For an exact candidate, add a review reason and submit a proposal.

00:01:34.426 --> 00:01:39.523
A proposal is not an approval, and it does not change accepted balances.

00:01:40.611 --> 00:01:44.812
A different reviewer checks the proposal.

00:01:44.812 --> 00:01:49.013
In this preview, switch to the demo approver to complete the review.

00:01:49.013 --> 00:01:53.213
Self approval is blocked, and the decision appears in workspace activity.

00:01:54.276 --> 00:01:58.050
Pragya Flow Finance.

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:01.824
Clear records, traceable decisions.

00:02:01.824 --> 00:02:05.599
This is an interactive product preview.

00:02:05.599 --> 00:02:09.373
Live imports, database processing, and A I driven reconciliation are not connected yet.
